      "message": "Do all tags on a project have to be unique? I can\u0027t have [\u0027blue\u0027, \u0027red\u0027, \u0027green\u0027, \u0027blue\u0027] tags on a project, can I? I don\u0027t think I saw any bits in the spec on that. The reason why I ask is because if we don\u0027t allow multiple of the same tags, then we might be able to use a uniqueness constraint between the project_id and the name to ensure ever tag is unique, instead of having an ID we\u0027ll never use.",
